    "body": "They are not yet in shipping Safari, but I assume they are in nightly. And from that bug it seems they went with `replaceWith()`. Anyway, sorry @WesNetmo, we are not changing these names. They have established themselves in the developer community through libraries and we have gotten plenty of feedback that brevity is important.\n",
